WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Two numbers flash in a stream of letters.
You catch the first. The second slips by.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:13.000
Researchers call that the attentional blink:
processing the first target can make the next harder to report.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:21.000
In 2007, a small study found changes
after three months of intensive meditation.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:28.000
But the researchers did not test
a twelve-minute commercial audio.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:36.000
That gap matters. Explore the original experiment,
try a free observation exercise, and judge the evidence before any offer.

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Final Vestige: source before story.
